## 📌 Project Description
This project demonstrates the use of **SHAP (SHapley Additive exPlanations)** to explain predictions from a **Random Forest classifier** trained on a loan prediction dataset.  
The goal is to make the model's decisions interpretable by analyzing feature contributions for individual predictions and globally across the dataset.

